  "bio": [
   {
    "text": "Vannifar led the Simic Combine as guildmaster, with Vorel leading in the field, and she was among the guild representatives in the Operation Desperation ritual that Nissa led.",
    "cites": [
     "war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22-r6",
     "war-spark-ravnica-operation-desperation-2019-06-05-e23"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-rallying-reluctant-2019-05-22#:~:text=his%20guildmaster%2C%20Prime%20Speaker%20Vannifar",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/war-spark-ravnica-operation-desperation-2019-06-05#:~:text=Suddenly%2C%20golden%20light%20poured,of%20twenty%2Done%20sightless%20eyes."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "She unseated Zegana's predecessor, which left the two on poor terms, though they were rivals who were like sisters.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-1-ghosts-of-our-past-r8",
     "episode-3-shadows-of-regret-r5"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-1-ghosts-of-our-past#:~:text=Kaya%20knew%20the%20pair,Vannifar%20unseated%20her%20predecessor.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-shadows-of-regret#:~:text=they%20were%20sisters%2C%20in%20their%20way"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "When Zegana was murdered, Teysa informed Vannifar, who moved from grief to outrage.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-2-monsters-we-became-e7",
     "episode-3-shadows-of-regret-e2"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-2-monsters-we-became#:~:text=it%20is%20with%20the,Combine%20has%20been%20killed.",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-shadows-of-regret#:~:text=Vannifar%20won%27t%20allow%20this%20to%20go%20unanswered."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "She arrived with Ral and Krenko as Proft named Trostani as the mastermind behind the killings.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-8-gods-of-chaos-e4",
     "episode-8-gods-of-chaos-e24"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-8-gods-of-chaos#:~:text=Vannifar%20was%20the%20last,arrive%2C%20shortly%20after%20Ral",
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-8-gods-of-chaos#:~:text=Trostani%20did%20this%2C%20all,behind%20it%20all%20along."
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "She revealed that Zegana had been seeking a cure for phyresis with her consent.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-9-beauty-in-destruction-e9"
    ],
    "links": [
     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-9-beauty-in-destruction#:~:text=She%20was%20seeking%20a,spreading%20taint%20of%20Phyrexia"
    ]
   }
  ],
